Z||000007||GTMike||12-12-2001||07:12 AM||||i would guess on a turbo car  your times would be lower that a NA car  because  the turbo will really spool up in the long strech in 3rd gear   as opposed to the short runs thrw 1st and 2nd gear.<P>any one know what i'm trying to say.  <P>saying  NA car runs 9.5  will get a 14.00<BR>a turbo car   at 9.5 in the 1/8th would have a lower 1/4 time  even if they both had the same 1/8 time.  ||||reg||1
